  <entry>
    <title>Hexo 常用命令速查</title>
    <link href="/2026/10/25/hexo-commands-cheatsheet/"/>
    <url>/2026/10/25/hexo-commands-cheatsheet/</url>
    
    <content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>这篇是写给自己的备忘录，顺便测试一下代码高亮。</p><h2 id="常用命令"><a href="#常用命令" class="headerlink" title="常用命令"></a>常用命令</h2><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br><span class="line">17</span><br><span class="line">18</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs bash"><span class="hljs-comment"># 本地预览，默认 http://localhost:4000</span><br>npm run dev<br><br><span class="hljs-comment"># 写新文章（会在 source/_posts/ 生成 xxx.md）</span><br>npx hexo new <span class="hljs-string">&quot;文章标题&quot;</span><br><br><span class="hljs-comment"># 写新页面（如 关于我）</span><br>npx hexo new page <span class="hljs-string">&quot;about&quot;</span><br><br><span class="hljs-comment"># 草稿箱（source/_drafts/，默认不渲染）</span><br>npx hexo new draft <span class="hljs-string">&quot;草稿标题&quot;</span><br>npx hexo publish draft 草稿标题<br><br><span class="hljs-comment"># 生成静态文件到 public/ 目录</span><br>npm run build<br><br><span class="hljs-comment"># 一键清理缓存 + 构建 + 部署（需配置 _config.yml 的 deploy）</span><br>npm run deploy<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2 id="文章-front-matter-模板"><a href="#文章-front-matter-模板" class="headerlink" title="文章 front-matter 模板"></a>文章 front-matter 模板</h2><figure class="highlight yaml"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs yaml"><span class="hljs-meta">---</span><br><span class="hljs-attr">title:</span> <span class="hljs-string">文章标题</span><br><span class="hljs-attr">date:</span> <span class="hljs-number">2026-10-25 21:30:00</span><br><span class="hljs-attr">tags:</span> [<span class="hljs-string">Java</span>, <span class="hljs-string">后端</span>]<br><span class="hljs-attr">categories:</span> [<span class="hljs-string">技术</span>]<br><span class="hljs-attr">cover:</span> <span class="hljs-string">/images/cover.jpg</span>   <span class="hljs-comment"># 部分主题支持封面图</span><br><span class="hljs-meta">---</span><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2 id="部署流程"><a href="#部署流程" class="headerlink" title="部署流程"></a>部署流程</h2><p>本地 <code>git push</code> → GitHub Actions 自动执行 <code>hexo generate</code> → 产物推送到 <code>gh-pages</code> 分支 → GitHub Pages 发布。全程无需人工干预。</p>]]></content>
    
    
